{
    "name": "Helped - PDF Autofill Make AI Agent",
    "flow": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "hook": 3679001,
                "maxResults": 1
            },
            "mapper": {},
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 0
                },
                "restore": {
                    "parameters": {
                        "hook": {
                            "data": {
                                "editable": "true"
                            },
                            "label": "WEBSITE AI WORKFLOW 2"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "hook",
                        "type": "hook:gateway-webhook",
                        "label": "Webhook",
                        "required": true
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "maxResults",
                        "type": "number",
                        "label": "Maximum number of results"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
            "version": 1,
            "mapper": null,
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 250,
                    "y": 0
                }
            },
            "routes": [
                {
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 27,
                            "module": "ai-local-agent:RunLocalAIAgent",
                            "version": 0,
                            "parameters": {
                                "makeConnectionId": 9990574
                            },
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Text document autofill - authorized",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.scenario}}",
                                            "b": "pdf_autofill",
                                            "o": "text:equal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.authToken}}",
                                            "b": "REPLACE_WITH_AUTH_TOKEN",
                                            "o": "text:equal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.fileDataBase64}}",
                                            "b": "",
                                            "o": "text:equal"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "files": [],
                                "message": "Website extraction instructions:\n{{1.systemPrompt}}\n\nPDF text and requested output schema:\n{{1.userPrompt}}",
                                "threadId": "pdf-autofill-{{ifempty(1.requestId; \"anonymous\")}}",
                                "outputType": "text",
                                "tokenLimit": "8192",
                                "modelConfig": {
                                    "timeout": "",
                                    "recursionLimit": "300",
                                    "iterationsFromHistoryCount": "1"
                                },
                                "defaultModel": "gpt-5-nano",
                                "systemPrompt": "You are a careful document extraction assistant. Follow the website extraction instructions exactly. Never invent values. Return only the requested JSON object. Do not use Markdown or comments.",
                                "promptCaching": "none",
                                "fallbackEnabled": false,
                                "reasoningEffort": "low"
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 550,
                                    "y": -120
                                },
                                "notes": "Make AI Agent for biodata and employment contract draft autofill. Verify the Make AI Provider connection and file-capable model."
                            },
                            "tools": []
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 28,
                            "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {},
                            "mapper": {
                                "body": "{\n  \"content\": \"{{escapeJSON(27.response)}}\",\n  \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n}",
                                "status": "200",
                                "headers": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 850,
                                    "y": -120
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 31,
                            "module": "ai-local-agent:RunLocalAIAgent",
                            "version": 0,
                            "parameters": {
                                "makeConnectionId": 9990574
                            },
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Image or scanned PDF autofill - authorized",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.scenario}}",
                                            "b": "pdf_autofill",
                                            "o": "text:equal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.authToken}}",
                                            "b": "REPLACE_WITH_AUTH_TOKEN",
                                            "o": "text:equal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.fileDataBase64}}",
                                            "b": "",
                                            "o": "text:notEqual"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "files": [
                                    {
                                        "fileName": "{{1.fileName}}",
                                        "data": "{{toBinary(1.fileDataBase64; \"base64\")}}"
                                    }
                                ],
                                "message": "Website extraction instructions:\n{{1.systemPrompt}}\n\nPDF text and requested output schema:\n{{1.userPrompt}}",
                                "threadId": "pdf-autofill-{{ifempty(1.requestId; \"anonymous\")}}",
                                "outputType": "text",
                                "tokenLimit": "8192",
                                "modelConfig": {
                                    "timeout": "",
                                    "recursionLimit": "300",
                                    "iterationsFromHistoryCount": "1"
                                },
                                "defaultModel": "gpt-5-nano",
                                "systemPrompt": "You are a careful document extraction assistant. Follow the website extraction instructions exactly. Never invent values. Return only the requested JSON object. Do not use Markdown or comments.",
                                "promptCaching": "none",
                                "fallbackEnabled": false,
                                "reasoningEffort": "low"
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 550,
                                    "y": 120
                                },
                                "notes": "Make AI Agent for biodata and employment contract draft autofill. Verify the Make AI Provider connection and file-capable model."
                            },
                            "tools": []
                        },
                        {
                            "id": 32,
                            "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {},
                            "mapper": {
                                "body": "{\n  \"content\": \"{{escapeJSON(31.response)}}\",\n  \"finish_reason\": \"stop\"\n}",
                                "status": "200",
                                "headers": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 850,
                                    "y": 120
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 30,
                            "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {},
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "PDF biodata autofill - unauthorized",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.scenario}}",
                                            "b": "pdf_autofill",
                                            "o": "text:equal"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.authToken}}",
                                            "b": "REPLACE_WITH_AUTH_TOKEN",
                                            "o": "text:notEqual"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "body": "{\"error\":\"Unauthorized\"}",
                                "status": "401",
                                "headers": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 550,
                                    "y": -220
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "flow": [
                        {
                            "id": 29,
                            "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
                            "version": 1,
                            "parameters": {},
                            "filter": {
                                "name": "Unsupported event",
                                "conditions": [
                                    [
                                        {
                                            "a": "{{1.scenario}}",
                                            "b": "pdf_autofill",
                                            "o": "text:notEqual"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                ]
                            },
                            "mapper": {
                                "body": "{\"error\":\"Unsupported website automation scenario\"}",
                                "status": "400",
                                "headers": [
                                    {
                                        "key": "Content-Type",
                                        "value": "application/json"
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            "metadata": {
                                "designer": {
                                    "x": 550,
                                    "y": 140
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "metadata": {
        "instant": true,
        "version": 1,
        "scenario": {
            "roundtrips": 1,
            "maxErrors": 3,
            "autoCommit": true,
            "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
            "sequential": false,
            "slots": null,
            "confidential": true,
            "dataloss": false,
            "dlq": false,
            "freshVariables": false
        },
        "designer": {
            "orphans": []
        },
        "zone": "eu1.make.com",
        "notes": [
            "Helped - PDF Autofill Make AI Agent — import-ready blueprint.",
            "",
            "AFTER IMPORT:",
            "1. WEBHOOK: After import, run the scenario once with a text draft and once with a JPG/PNG so Module 1 learns fileDataBase64, fileName, and fileMimeType.",
            "2. AI AGENTS: Verify the Make AI Provider connection and select a model that supports JPG, PNG, and PDF input files.",
            "3. AUTH TOKEN: In both AI Agent modules AND Module 30 filter conditions, replace REPLACE_WITH_AUTH_TOKEN with the exact same value as MAKE_PDF_AUTOFILL_WEBHOOK_TOKEN.",
            "4. WORKER SECRETS (Cloudflare):",
            "   npx wrangler secret put MAKE_PDF_AUTOFILL_WEBHOOK_URL   (paste the webhook URL)",
            "   npx wrangler secret put MAKE_PDF_AUTOFILL_WEBHOOK_TOKEN (paste the auth token)",
            "5. TEST: POST {scenario:\"pdf_autofill\", requestId, systemPrompt, userPrompt, fileName, fileMimeType, fileDataBase64, authToken} to the webhook. For text files leave the file fields out. Expect 200 + {\"content\", \"finish_reason\"}.",
            "6. ACTIVATE: Toggle scenario ON.",
            "",
            "AUTH: requests with a missing or wrong authToken receive 401, unknown scenario receives 400."
        ]
    }
}
